Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Aurora Team <aurora@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/aurora-linux/aurora
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/aurora-linux/aurora.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/aurora-linux/aurora
Built-Using: debhelper (= 13.11.6ubuntu1)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Priority: optional

Depends: ${misc:Depends}, aurora-themes, aurora-icons, aurora-cursors, aurora-fonts, aurora-colors, aurora-wallpapers, aurora-branding
Recommends: aurora-terminal-themes, aurora-vscode, aurora-jetbrains
Suggests: aurora-kde-themes, aurora-kde-integration, aurora-gnome-integration, aurora-sddm, aurora-gdm, aurora-accessibility, aurora-plymouth

Description: Aurora Linux Design System — Complete package
 Aurora is a comprehensive Linux design system providing a cohesive visual
 experience across all major desktop environments and applications.
 .
 This meta-package installs all core Aurora components including:
 .
  • GTK, Qt, and Plasma themes
  • Icon theme sets
  • Cursor themes
  • System fonts
  • Color palettes and design tokens
  • Wallpaper collection
  • Brand assets
  • Terminal themes
  • Code editor themes (VS Code, JetBrains)
 .
 Optional packages include desktop environment-specific integrations and
 accessibility enhancements.
 .
 For more information, visit: https://github.com/aurora-linux/aurora
